zach, Switzerland, where the first foreign subsidiary had been established in 1933."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d01", "start": 342, "end": 463, "text": "Closely linked to the history of Heubach is the evolvement of Hirschbrauerei Heubach, the long-established local brewery."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d01", "start": 464, "end": 576, "text": "Still family owned the brewery's history goes back to the 17th century, first documented proofs go back to 1725."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d01", "start": 577, "end": 620, "text": "Heubach is the home of Fritz Reu GmbH & Co."}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d02", "start": 0, "end": 26, "text": "and customized solutions ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d02", "start": 27, "end": 151, "text": "To learn more about our global manufacturing footprint and our sales offices across the world click on the dots in the map ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d02", "start": 152, "end": 522, "text": "Contact us .st1 { fill : # 036260 } .st2 { stroke-dasharray:0,1.986 } .st2 , .st3 , .st4 { fill : none ; stroke : # 036260 ; stroke-width : .999 ; stroke-linecap : round ; stroke-linejoin : round } .st4 { stroke-dasharray:0,2.008 } .st10 { fill : # 69b42e } .st11 { stroke-dasharray:0,2.004 } .st11 , .st12 , .st22 { fill : none ; stroke : # 69b42e ; stroke-width : .999"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "porcelain-headed bisque dolls", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d00:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Fritz Reu GmbH & Co.", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d01:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d00:c0", "entity": "Heubach", "scope": "primary product", "claim": "Ernst Heubach was a company that